entries.what:
Before the freeze, confirm.py gained:
- the development-gate refusal (GATE_NOT_PASSED, with the --despite-gate override recorded in the lock);
- a zero arm scored on the 19Q4 generic profile (prediction-time information; the first draft used the sealed batch's own profile, an oracle);
- an outcome-ID guard (OUTCOME_ID_MISMATCH below 90% matched);
- prediction-time strata;
- calibration;
- all three nulls for the context shift;
- the replication ceiling.
The evaluate step was smoke-tested on synthetic predictions and a synthetic outcome matrix only.
